Package: com.vcamfullmay.tweak
Name: VcamFullMay
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Virtual camera tweak + companion app. Feeds frames from a user-chosen video file into AVCaptureSession so any app using the standard camera API sees the video instead of the live feed. Companion app (VCam, on Home Screen) provides a GUI to toggle the tweak, pick a video from Files, and view status. Includes basic JB hide (filesystem path probes, URL scheme probes, dlopen of substrate dylibs). Audio (mic) stream is untouched.
Maintainer: Hieudeptrai04
Author: Hieudeptrai04
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit | mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 15.0)
Tag: role::enduser
